<Layouts.marketing_shell flash={@flash}>
  <article class="max-w-[1320px] mx-auto px-8 max-md:px-4 max-[460px]:px-3 py-[clamp(48px,7vw,96px)] max-md:py-[40px]">
    <header class="mb-[clamp(36px,5vw,64px)] max-md:mb-8 max-w-[40ch]">
      <h1 class="font-brand-sans font-black text-[clamp(40px,6vw,84px)] max-md:text-[36px] leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.04em] text-ink">
        An <span class="text-brand-accent-d italic">experiment</span>.
      </h1>
    </header>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_1.4fr] gap-[clamp(32px,5vw,80px)] max-[820px]:grid-cols-1 max-[820px]:gap-8">
      <aside class="text-mid text-[14px] leading-[1.6] tracking-[-0.005em]">
        <p>
          imaedge is one of several small tools I run from <a
            class="text-ink underline decoration-black/20 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-ink transition-colors"
            href="https://v01.io"
          >v01.io</a>. It started as a private fix for a private problem on a single trip. It is still that.
        </p>
      </aside>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-[clamp(20px,2.5vw,32px)] max-w-[60ch]">
        <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[clamp(22px,2.4vw,30px)] max-md:text-[20px] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink">
            Open source. Self host whenever you want.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-ink-2 text-[16px] max-md:text-[15px] leading-[1.6]">
            The whole stack lives on GitHub, under <a
              class="text-ink underline decoration-black/20 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-ink transition-colors"
              href="https://github.com/klausbreyer/imaedge"
            >klausbreyer/imaedge</a>. If you want your own instance, take it. There is also a small
            <a
              class="text-ink underline decoration-black/20 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-ink transition-colors"
              href="https://github.com/klausbreyer/imaedge-gallery-wp-importer"
            >
              WordPress importer
            </a>
            for pushing a finished collection into a WordPress gallery.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[clamp(22px,2.4vw,30px)] max-md:text-[20px] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink">
            It cannot stay free forever.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-ink-2 text-[16px] max-md:text-[15px] leading-[1.6]">
            Storage and bandwidth cost money, so at some point this needs a way to pay for itself. The promise here is narrow: whatever was started under the current rules stays under the current rules. Existing collections will not be monetized after the fact, gated behind a paywall, or held hostage. New behavior, if any, applies to new things.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[clamp(22px,2.4vw,30px)] max-md:text-[20px] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink">
            No guarantees.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-ink-2 text-[16px] max-md:text-[15px] leading-[1.6]">
            This is a personal experiment. Treat it as one. Keep your own copy of anything you care about. There is no SLA, no support contract, no payment, and no insurance against the day a single mistake on my side takes it offline.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[clamp(22px,2.4vw,30px)] max-md:text-[20px] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink">
            Imprint and contact.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-ink-2 text-[16px] max-md:text-[15px] leading-[1.6]">
            There is no separate imprint page for imaedge. For legal details about who runs this, see the
            <a
              class="text-ink underline decoration-black/20 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-ink transition-colors"
              href="https://v01.io"
            >
              v01.io
            </a>
            site. For anything else, email <a
              class="text-ink underline decoration-black/20 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-ink transition-colors"
              href="mailto:kb@v01.io"
            >kb@v01.io</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layouts.marketing_shell>
